   This overstates actual routing. Chat streaming uses `/api/chat-proxy` only when `shouldProxyModel()` returns true; allowlisted providers are called directly. OpenAI transcription uses the proxy, but Google transcription calls `GoogleGenAI` directly. Thus the listed operations do not uniformly use the same route.

